---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Portrait from '../components/Portrait.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Anuj"
  description="Meet Anuj Yadav: coach, trainer, entrepreneur, speaker, and educator connecting business strategy, leadership, and practical learning."
>
  <section class="container page-hero about-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT ANUJ / THE PERSON BEHIND THE WORK</p>
      <h1>
        Different disciplines.
        <br />
        <em>One human thread.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Business gets better when people grow. People grow when they have the clarity, skills, and
        space to take their next step.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Portrait compact />
  </section>
  <section class="container section intro-grid">
    <p class="eyebrow">A CONNECTED PERSPECTIVE</p>
    <div>
      <h2>
        Strategy meets learning.
        <br />
        <em>Learning meets action.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="prose">
        Anuj Yadav is a coach, trainer, entrepreneur, motivational speaker, and educator. His work
        spans business growth, leadership, personal development, digital marketing, AI, and personal
        branding.
      </p>
      <p class="prose">
        These disciplines share a common question: how can an idea become something useful in
        someone’s work or life? Anuj The Coach brings that question into speaking, workshops,
        coaching, and education.
      </p>
      <p class="prose">
        The approach starts with context: where you are, what matters to you, and what is getting in
        the way. From there, the focus is on clearer thinking and practical next steps.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="principles-section">
    <div class="container section">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE APPROACH</p>
      <h2>
        Grounded in people.
        <br />
        <em>Oriented toward progress.</em>
      </h2>
      <div class="three-columns">
        {[
          [
            '01',
            'Clarity before complexity.',
            'Make the question useful before making the answer elaborate. Start with what matters most.',
          ],
          [
            '02',
            'Practical beats abstract.',
            'Connect ideas to decisions, conversations, and actions people can use in their own context.',
          ],
          [
            '03',
            'Stay open. Keep learning.',
            'Technology changes. People and businesses evolve. Curiosity belongs in the work.',
          ],
        ].map(([num, title, text]) => (
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">{num}</span>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{text}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>
        The ventures
        <br />
        <em>behind the perspective.</em>
      </h2>
      <p>Related work. A shared focus on growth.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="two-columns">
      <div class="editorial-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">DIGITAL & BUSINESS</p>
        <h3>DigiARV</h3>
        <p>Digital marketing, AI-enabled business solutions, and digital education.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="editorial-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE & DEVELOPMENT</p>
        <h3>NourishNudge</h3>
        <p>Coaching, training, soft skills, communication, and professional development.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="editorial-note">
      <strong>A profile in progress.</strong> A detailed professional biography and verified
      experience will be added here. No client history, qualifications, or awards are implied.
    </aside>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</Layout>
